{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（6日）上午10時許，警方接獲一名保安員報案，指深水埗高登電腦中心其中一個樓層冒煙。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約17分鐘後將火救熄。事件中無人受傷。據初步調查，火警涉及電子零件，具體原因仍有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260906/1173225577331822592481605.jpeg/Kxe2ZWo8mrSG-Y8EvHTFG_j-r_71pDLdjK7rB6mu6wc\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是高登電腦中心。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260906/1173225574521507840109548.jpeg/vKvL8SNDFzQb676ZE7eyf83kl1YcRSkOC5_YMS6f2DE\"/><figcaption>現場是高登電腦中心。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260906/1173225571224653824345602.jpeg/9VcGmNdg8POZiWriDznyf0lmLBgGJqzmNY7S6BCO0ug\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T03:18:56.638016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}